{"id":"2a0da9658aff7b80","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-ordinal-notation.md","title":"Ordinal Notation","display":"df-ordinal-notation — Ordinal Notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-ordinal-notation","aliases":["72-df-ordinal-notation"],"display":"df-ordinal-notation — Ordinal Notation","depends_on":["[[72-df-recursive-function]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local derivation in ZFC; book background Ch.IV §1.1, print210–214; PDF222–226","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-ordinal-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-ordinal-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-notation — Ordinal Notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local derivation in ZFC; book background Ch.IV §1.1, print210–214; PDF222–226"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(O\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq O^2\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq O^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 为 von Neumann 序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:O\\to\\alpha\">\\(v:O\\to\\alpha\\)</span> 为集合函数。序数真类仅用作元语言参数范围；这里不构造从 O 到整个真类的集合函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_O:\\omega^1\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_O:\\omega^1\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_\\prec:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_\\prec:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是特征函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_O(\\langle n\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in O\">\\(\\chi_O(\\langle n\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_\\prec(\\langle m,n\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow m\\prec n\">\\(\\chi_\\prec(\\langle m,n\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow m\\prec n\\)</span>。总递归性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f38fcd2964b78d6c\" href=\"?note=f38fcd2964b78d6c\" title=\"72-df-recursive-function\">72-df-recursive-function</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdNot},\\mathrm{RecOrdNot}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdNot},\\mathrm{RecOrdNot}\\)</span> 是下式定义的四参数谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(f,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(f,n)\\)</span> 取上游同名谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ran}(v)=\\alpha\\land\\forall x,y\\in O\\ (v(x)=v(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\forall x,y\\in O\\ (x\\prec y\\leftrightarrow v(x)\\in v(y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ran}(v)=\\alpha\\land\\forall x,y\\in O\\ (v(x)=v(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\forall x,y\\in O\\ (x\\prec y\\leftrightarrow v(x)\\in v(y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecOrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{OrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(\\chi_O,1)\\land\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(\\chi_\\prec,2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RecOrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{OrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(\\chi_O,1)\\land\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(\\chi_\\prec,2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>值域、单射以及序保持和反射条件共同规定 v 是序同构，因而也保证 (O,≺) 是严格良序。空载体和零序数由空函数一致处理。有效性作用在载体和比较关系上，而不是要求“某个 O→ω 映射可计算”的空条件。来源背景为第 IV 章 §1.1 的序类型及第 III 章有效表示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"f38fcd2964b78d6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\chi_O:\\omega^1\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 与 $\\chi_\\prec:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是特征函数，$\\chi_O(\\langle n\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in O$，$\\chi_\\prec(\\langle m,n\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow m\\prec n$。总递归性见 [[72-df-recursive-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"O\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec\\subseteq O^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"v:O\\to\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_O:\\omega^1\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_\\prec:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_O(\\langle n\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in O","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_\\prec(\\langle m,n\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow m\\prec n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdNot},\\mathrm{RecOrdNot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(f,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{ran}(v)=\\alpha\\land\\forall x,y\\in O\\ (v(x)=v(y)\\to x=y)\\land\\forall x,y\\in O\\ (x\\prec y\\leftrightarrow v(x)\\in v(y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecOrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{OrdNot}(O,\\prec,v;\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(\\chi_O,1)\\land\\mathrm{TotalRecFun}(\\chi_\\prec,2).","display":true}],"bytes":1948,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-ordinal-notation|df-ordinal-notation — Ordinal Notation]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-ordinal-notation|df-ordinal-notation — Ordinal Notation]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-ordinal-notation|72-df-ordinal-notation]]"}],"outgoing":["f38fcd2964b78d6c"]}